      "content": "I'm seeing some significant latency spikes in our production Kubernetes cluster during peak load. Specifically, we're seeing a bottleneck in the service mesh layer when handling inter-service communication via mTLS. We've ruled out resource exhaustion on the worker nodes. Could you help me troubleshoot potential configuration issues in the sidecar proxy injection or suggest how to optimize the handshake overhead?",
